WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:01.725
My name is Shweta.

2
00:00:01.725 --> 00:00:03.385
I live in Luxembourg.

3
00:00:03.385 --> 00:00:05.875
I work as an expert accountant and

4
00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:08.480
adviser for the senior leadership.

5
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.126
We were not even given any agenda,

6
00:00:11.126 --> 00:00:13.470
so that we could know what was

7
00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:14.690
waiting for us.

8
00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:17.531
They always say that the unknown

9
00:00:17.531 --> 00:00:19.080
has a lot for us,

10
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.588
but what actually was waiting for

11
00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:23.810
us, it actually blew my mind.

12
00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.104
It's crazy how I thought I could

13
00:00:26.104 --> 00:00:28.125
do everything on my own, but

14
00:00:28.125 --> 00:00:30.005
the group changes everything.

15
00:00:30.005 --> 00:00:31.819
If you see us now, it's like we've

16
00:00:31.819 --> 00:00:33.633
known each other for so many days,

17
00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:35.250
and it's been just three days.

18
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.210
I can't tell how many times I cried.

19
00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:40.243
I've seen so many beautiful parts

20
00:00:40.243 --> 00:00:41.200
of me in there,

21
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:41.860
it's

22
00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:43.045
actually mind-blowing.

23
00:00:43.045 --> 00:00:46.010
It's like a blessing for me that I

24
00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:48.807
didn't expect was going to bring

25
00:00:48.807 --> 00:00:50.840
so much good out of me.
